{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/792543-hopes-for-new-groups-in-2e","id":792543,"title":"Hopes for new groups in 2e?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-24T21:32:51-08:00","id":792543,"title":"Hopes for new groups in 2e?","content":"Inspired by the thread about changes you'd like to see, what new Compacts and Conspiracies would you enjoy in Hunter 2e?<br /> <br /> I think there's an obvious demand for groups from outside of America, and I'm sure we'll see a lot of those in the setting chapters (fingers crossed for the Hotogisu; I'd love to see a Chinese group with government backing, and some sort of group with roots in the British intelligence community. A tradition of West African or Caribbean hunters who deal with ghosts would be absolutely stellar.<br /> <br /> There has to be a dedicated Changeling group (it's criminal that Mortal Remains doesn't have one in it), and I'd love for it to spin off in a direction that doesn't immediately call Grimm stories to mind. Was it the fan-book that King's Raven worked on that had a UFO abductee group in it? That angle is great.<br /> <br /> Organizations focused on threats that aren't easily classified in the CofD - like aliens, or shadow people - or who have explanations for the supernatural that don't jive easily with the established gamelines would be great. Maybe bring in a bunch of nutjobs who want to try freeing the monsters from the psychic parasites in their skulls via trepanning?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-24T21:39:18-08:00","id":792547,"title":"","content":"I am really enjoying the latest trend towards progress and representation, so I have high hopes we'll see a group with African, Asian or Latin American ethnicities and origins. I must say I am personally biased here, but I'd love to see a group like The Union that started as a LGBT defence group vs. hate crimes and supernatural depredations, and later evolved into a proper compact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T00:11:32-08:00","id":792637,"title":"","content":"you know, all of the 2E books have an &quot;around the world&quot; section. It would be a shame if it won't be used in order to present new groups- even if mentioning just by the name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T08:26:51-08:00","id":792749,"title":"","content":"I'd love to see a European Union version of Task Force: VALKYRYE. Not nescessarily a paramilitar organization with access to Advanced Armory, but an official organization of the EU, with finantiation of the EU, that huts supernaturals.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-25T16:35:18-08:00","id":792869,"title":"","content":"